  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$b_1=4$，$q=-3$两个条件给出等比数列",
        "$4,-12,36,-108,\\cdots$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们发现，在$q<0$的情况下，数列的奇数项和第1项的",
        "符号相同，而数列的偶数项和第1项的符号相反. 在这种情",
        "况下，数列既不是增数列，又不是减数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果$q>0(q\\ne1)$，那么数列或是增数列，或是减数列. 例",
        "如，设$b_1=-2$，$q=3$. 在这种情况下，等比数列",
        "$-2,-6,-18,\\cdots$",
        "是减数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果$q=1$，那么数列所有的项彼此相等. 在这种情况下，",
        "数列就是常数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "等比数列具有下述性质：从第2项起，等比数列任何一",
        "项都等于它的前面一项与随后一项的比例中项."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来证明这个性质. 设数列$(b_n)$是等比数列，$b_{n-1},b_n,b_{n+1}$是任",
        "意取出的它的三个连续的项$(n\\geqslant2)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "等比数列的任何一项与前面一项的比都等于一个常数，因此",
        "$\\frac{b_{n+1}}{b_n}=\\frac{b_n}{b_{n-1}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "反过来也成立：如果某一个数列，从第2项起，它的任何",
        "一项都等于它前面一项与随后一项的比例中项，那么这个数",
        "列就是等比数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "实际上，假设对于某数列$(b_n)$任何三个连续的项$b_{n-1},b_n,b_{n+1}(n\\geqslant↵2)$，下列关系式成立：",
        "$\\frac{b_{n+1}}{b_n}=\\frac{b_n}{b_{n-1}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这就是说，数列$(b_n)$的任何一项对前面一项的比都等于一个常数，",
        "数列$(b_n)$是等比数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "· 96 ·"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
